<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ rating to Nippon Life Insurance.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ rating to Nippon Life Insurance.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Wednesday that it had assigned its AA+ claims-paying ability rating to Nippon Life Insurance Co.</p>
</text>
